# Use Shared UI Components and Design Tokens

## Components

NEVER write inline button, card, badge, or table styles. Always use the shared components from `$lib/components/ui/`.

### Button

```svelte
<!-- ✅ CORRECT -->
import Button from '$lib/components/ui/Button.svelte';

<Button variant="primary" size="md">Save</Button>
<Button variant="secondary">Cancel</Button>
<Button variant="danger" disabled={loading}>Delete</Button>
<Button variant="primary" href="/leagues">View Leagues</Button>

<!-- ❌ WRONG — inline button styles -->
<button class="bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-500 text-white rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors px-4 py-2">
  Save
</button>
```

**Variants:** `primary` (orange), `secondary` (zinc), `danger` (red), `success` (green), `warning` (yellow), `ghost` (transparent)
**Sizes:** `sm`, `md` (default), `lg`
**With href:** renders as `<a>` tag — use for navigation

### Card

```svelte
<!-- ✅ CORRECT -->
import Card from '$lib/components/ui/Card.svelte';

<Card>Content</Card>
<Card padding="lg">Wide content</Card>
<Card padding="none" class="overflow-hidden">Table inside</Card>
```

**Padding:** `none`, `sm`, `md` (default), `lg`
**Extra classes:** pass via `class` prop for layout overrides

<!-- ❌ WRONG — inline card container -->
<div class="bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg p-6">...</div>

### Badge

```svelte
<!-- ✅ CORRECT -->
import Badge from '$lib/components/ui/Badge.svelte';

<Badge color="green">Active</Badge>
<Badge color="red" size="md">Banned</Badge>
<Badge color="blue">2v2</Badge>
<Badge color="purple">1v1</Badge>

<!-- ❌ WRONG — inline badge styles -->
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-green-500/20 text-green-400 border border-green-500/30 rounded-full text-xs font-medium">
  Active
</span>
```

**Colors:** `green`, `red`, `yellow`, `blue`, `purple`, `orange`, `zinc` (default)
**Sizes:** `sm` (default), `md`

