## Design Tokens

Use semantic token class names instead of raw Tailwind color classes. These are defined in `src/app.css` via `@theme`.

### Color decisions

| Context | Use | Not |
|---------|-----|-----|
| Primary action (brand) | `bg-primary-600` | `bg-orange-600` |
| 2v2 format context | `bg-format-2v2-600` | `bg-blue-600` |
| 1v1 format context | `bg-format-1v1-600` | `bg-purple-600` |
| Card background | `bg-surface-card` | `bg-zinc-900` |
| Input background | `bg-surface-input` | `bg-zinc-800` |
| Hover surface | `bg-surface-hover` | `bg-zinc-700` |
| Default border | `border-border-default` | `border-zinc-800` |
| Input border | `border-border-input` | `border-zinc-700` |
| Body text | `text-text-body` | `text-gray-400` |
| Label text | `text-text-label` | `text-gray-300` |
| Muted text | `text-text-muted` | `text-gray-500` |
| Success | `bg-success-600` / `text-success-400` | `bg-green-600` |
| Danger | `bg-danger-600` / `text-danger-400` | `bg-red-600` |
| Warning | `bg-warning-600` / `text-warning-400` | `bg-yellow-600` |
| Info | `bg-info-600` / `text-info-400` | `bg-blue-600` |

### Format colors rule

**Only use `format-2v2-*` or `format-1v1-*` tokens when the context is explicitly about that format** (league cards, format-specific sections, format badges). For generic actions that are not format-specific, always use `primary-*` (orange).

Admin pages use `primary-*` (orange), not blue. Blue is reserved for 2v2 format contexts only.

### DataTable

```svelte
<!-- ✅ CORRECT -->
import DataTable, { type Column } from '$lib/components/ui/DataTable.svelte';

const columns: Column[] = [
  { key: 'name', label: 'Name' },
  { key: 'status', label: 'Status', align: 'center' },
  { key: 'actions', label: 'Actions', align: 'right', srOnly: true },
];

<DataTable {data} {columns}>
  {#snippet cell(row, col)}
    {#if col.key === 'name'}
      <span class="font-semibold text-white">{row.name}</span>
    {:else if col.key === 'status'}
      <Badge color="green">{row.status}</Badge>
    {:else if col.key === 'actions'}
      <Button variant="ghost" size="sm">Edit</Button>
    {/if}
  {/snippet}
</DataTable>

<!-- ❌ WRONG — raw table with inline styles -->
<div class="bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
  <table class="w-full">...</table>
</div>
```

**Props:**
- `data: T[]` — array of row objects
- `columns: Column[]` — column definitions (`key`, `label`, `align?`, `width?`, `srOnly?`)
- `cell: Snippet<[T, Column]>` — render snippet for each cell
- `emptyMessage?` / `emptyIcon?` — shown when data is empty
- `onRowClick?: (row: T) => void` — makes rows clickable
- `rowClass?: (row: T) => string` — conditional row styling
- `compact?: boolean` — tighter padding
- `pagination?: { currentPage, totalPages, onPageChange, infoText? }` — adds paginator
- `expandedRow? / expandedContent?` — collapsible row detail

