## Form Components

NEVER write raw `<input>` or `<select>` with inline Tailwind styling for visible labeled form fields.

```svelte
<!-- ✅ CORRECT -->
import FormInput from '$lib/components/ui/form/FormInput.svelte';
import FormSelect from '$lib/components/ui/form/FormSelect.svelte';

<FormInput label="Team Name" name="name" bind:value={name} required />
<FormSelect label="Division" name="division" bind:value={division} options={[{ value: '1', label: 'Premier' }]} />

<!-- ❌ WRONG — raw inputs with inline styles -->
<label for="name">Team Name</label>
<input id="name" name="name" class="bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700 rounded-lg..." />
```

**Keep as-is (no shared component):** `<input type="hidden">`, `<input type="file">`, `<input type="checkbox">`, `<input type="radio">`, `<input type="range">`, `<textarea>`

## ConfirmDialog

NEVER use `window.confirm()` or `confirm()` for destructive action confirmations.

```svelte
<!-- ✅ CORRECT -->
import ConfirmDialog from '$lib/components/ui/ConfirmDialog.svelte';

let showConfirm = $state(false);

<Button variant="danger" onclick={() => showConfirm = true}>Delete</Button>

<ConfirmDialog
  open={showConfirm}
  title="Delete Item"
  description="Are you sure?"
  variant="danger"
  onConfirm={() => { doDelete(); showConfirm = false; }}
  onCancel={() => showConfirm = false}
/>

<!-- ❌ WRONG -->
<button onclick={() => { if (confirm('Delete?')) doDelete(); }}>Delete</button>
```

