## Banned Color Patterns

These raw Tailwind classes must NEVER appear in route `.svelte` files:

| Banned | Use instead |
|--------|-------------|
| `bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-*` on buttons | `Button variant="primary"` |
| `bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-*` on buttons | `Button variant="primary"` |
| `bg-indigo-600` on buttons | `Button variant="primary"` |
| `bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 rounded` containers | `Card` component |
| `emerald-*` | `green-*` or `success-*` tokens |
| `amber-*` | `yellow-*` or `warning-*` tokens |
| `text-zinc-300` / `text-zinc-400` / `text-zinc-500` | `text-text-label` / `text-text-body` / `text-text-muted` |
| `focus:ring-blue-500` / `focus:ring-indigo-500` | `focus:ring-primary-500` |
